1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,000
Welcome to the show.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Tonight we will look at three
cities rebuilt by their people.

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:11,000
First, the harbor district.

4
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:13,500
Then the old town.

5
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:16,000
And finally the riverfront,
where the market now stands.

6
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:17,800
The city never sleeps.

7
00:00:17,800 --> 00:00:18,500
Neither do its people.
